  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "The Construction-Sim of Rail-Across-Suite: a project's net construction stage by construction stage — what is in service on each day, what comes and what goes (decision 0027; roadmap, phase 5) —, and its timetable run in construction scenarios with stretches of track closed for a while, trains taken out and diverted (decision 0030)",
